        <h1>How Social Media Management Works for DTC Brands</h1>
        <div class="post-meta">
          <span>By <a href="/about/"><strong>Kevin Freeland</strong></a></span>
          <span>March 13, 2026</span>
          <span>9 min read</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="post-featured-img">
      <img src="/blog/images/social-media-management-florida.jpg" alt="Social media management dashboard for a DTC brand" width="860" height="400" />
